      "blocks": {
        "zt_q1": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "What is Zeotein?",
            "answer": "<p>A protein shake with every ingredient named on the label. Zeotein Cacao has 23g of protein from grass-fed bone broth and grass-fed collagen. Zeotein Vegan has 20g of plant protein from organic pumpkin seed and hemp.</p>",
            "link_label": "",
            "link_url": ""
          }
        },
        "zt_q2": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "What's the difference between Cacao and Vegan?",
            "answer": "<p>Cacao provides 23g of protein from collagen peptides + grass-fed beef bone broth, with a rich cacao flavor. Vegan provides 20g of plant-based protein from organic hemp + pumpkin seed protein.</p>",
            "link_label": "",
            "link_url": ""
          }
        },
        "zt_q3": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "What does Zeotein taste like?",
            "answer": "<p>This is what clean tastes like. Cacao is a creamy chocolate with a lightly cacao-forward taste. Vegan is naturally nutty. Most people mix it with milk, oat milk or coffee, and your recipe guides have more ways to make it yours.</p>",
            "link_label": "",
            "link_url": ""
          }
        },
        "zt_q4": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "How do I use Zeotein?",
            "answer": "<p>Cacao: two scoops from the bag or one stick. Vegan: one stick. Mix into 10 to 12 oz of water, milk or a milk alternative, then shake it or blend it.</p>",
            "link_label": "",
            "link_url": ""
          }
        },
        "zt_q5": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Is It Gluten Free And Dairy Free?",
            "answer": "<p>Yes. Both blends are gluten free and dairy free. Cacao is made with grass-fed beef bone broth and grass-fed collagen. Vegan is fully plant-based.</p>",
            "link_label": "",
            "link_url": ""
          }
        },
        "zt_q6": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Can I change or cancel my subscription?",
            "answer": "<p>Yes. You can manage, skip, pause, swap, or cancel your subscription through the customer portal.</p>",
            "link_label": "Manage My Subscription",
            "link_url": "https://zeotein.com/a/subscriptions/login"
          }
        },
        "zt_q7": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "What is your shipping and guarantee policy?",
            "answer": "<p>Orders are generally processed within 1–2 business days, with standard U.S. shipping taking 2–5 business days after processing. Zeotein also offers a 30-day money-back guarantee on eligible first orders. The guarantee applies to one supply and starts from the date of delivery.</p>",
